    CR_Manager -->|access| LWS_Scale
    CR_Manager -->|access| Monitoring
    CR_MetricsAuth -->|access| TokenReview
    CR_MetricsAuth -->|access| SAR
    R_Leader -->|access| Leases
    R_Leader -->|access| LeaderEvents

